# One ignore file for the whole monorepo. The rules are PATH-SCOPED on purpose:
# the three repos this was merged from each had a blanket rule that was safe in
# isolation and destructive here.
#
#   feed-mind ignored  *.json  -> would swallow firebase.json,
#                                 firestore.indexes.json, package.json,
#                                 package-lock.json and every web fixture
#   paper-prism ignored *.md   -> would swallow feed-mind's and the
#                                 summarizer's docs
#
# Both are replaced below by rules that name what is actually secret. If you add
# a rule here, prefer a path (apps/web/dist/) over a glob (dist/).

# --- OS / editor ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo
.venv/
venv/
.uv/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/

# --- Secrets and local config ---
# NEVER reintroduce a bare `*.json` here; see the header.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
env.yaml
secrets.txt
service-account*.json
*-service-account*.json
credentials.json
*.key
*.pem
*.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example

# --- Web (apps/web) ---
apps/web/node_modules/
apps/web/dist/
apps/web/.vite/

# --- Firebase ---
.firebase/
firebase-debug.log

# --- Terraform (infra/terraform) ---
infra/terraform/.terraform/
infra/terraform/*.tfstate
infra/terraform/*.tfstate.*
crash.log

# --- Deploy staging ---
# scripts/stage-service.sh assembles a service plus feedmind_core here, because
# `gcloud functions deploy --source` uploads one directory and the shared
# package lives outside it. Rebuilt from scratch on every deploy.
services/*/.build/

# --- Service run artifacts ---
services/paper-prism/output/
*.mp3
*.wav
*.m4a
*.aiff
*.log

# --- Local-only notes ---
# paper-prism kept these out of git with a blanket `*.md` + allowlist. Naming
# them individually means a NEW doc is tracked by default rather than silently
# ignored, which is the failure mode that rule had.
docs/paper-prism/extended-prompt.md
docs/paper-prism/filtering-evaluation-decision.md
docs/paper-prism/initial_prompt.md
docs/paper-prism/new-reqt.md
docs/paper-prism/voice-bot-design.md

# Claude Code local settings — machine-specific, never shared
.claude/settings.local.json
